(Pursat): A victim was struck by lightning and died instantly under his house while washing his motorbike under the house while it was raining.
This incident happened at 15:30 on October 3, 2020 in Boeung Smouk village, Svay Sor commune, Krakor district, Pursat province.
According to the local police report, the victim who was killed by lightning was named Phnom Chulsa, male, 23 years old, living in Boeung Smouk village, Svay Sor commune, Krakor district, Pursat province.
Before the incident, the sky was raining and then the sky was a little less rainy, but there was still a mixture of wind, thunder and lightning, the victims, along with their wives and children, were under the house to wipe the motorcycle. After washing, the victim was struck by lightning and killed. His wife and another small child were not injured.
