General Ith Sarath and 3 other dignitaries receive honorary doctorates from the University of Cambodia
(Phnom Penh): General Ith Sarath, Deputy Commander-in-Chief and Joint Chief of Staff of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, along with three other dignitaries who have contributed to the socio-economic development of the country, received this afternoon, October 3, 2020. Honorary Doctorate from the University of Cambodia.
The awarding ceremony of the honorary doctorate degrees to the four outstanding dignitaries was presided over by Dr. Kao Kim Hourn, Founder, Chairman and Rector of the University of Cambodia at the Southeast Asia Television Theater. Many distinguished guests as well.
Dr. Kao Kim Hourn stated that in the academic year 2020-2021, the University of Cambodia has a special program to award honorary doctorates in a number of important disciplines to Cambodian and foreign dignitaries who have great merit to contribute to the construction. Protect and develop Cambodia from underdevelopment and poverty.
He further stated that the dignitaries selected for the honorary doctorate degree of the University of Cambodia are all exemplary elites who have donated their physical, mental and intellectual strength as well as resources and knowledge with self-sacrifice, even age. Life for the cause of improving the quality of education - building - protecting and developing the nation and motherland for sustainable development, security and peace.
Dr. expressed the hope that the dignitaries will continue to contribute their physical and mental strength and intellect for the cause of building, defending and developing our country for prosperity, prosperity and strong peace today.
In particular, the University of Cambodia will strive to recruit more dignitaries, advanced intellectuals and outstanding leaders in both public and private sectors to receive honorary doctorates from Cambodian universities in order to contribute to building a model elite for the younger generation. Use leading knowledge and expertise for the cause of building and developing our nation to be as prosperous and prosperous as the civilizations in the world.
