(Kampong Cham): The case of throwing a car package causing the death of a driver on the night of September 29, 2020 on National Road No. 71 in front of a rubber plantation in Bang 2 village, Bos Khnour commune, Chamkar Leu district, Kampong Cham province The case has been dismantled by arresting two perpetrators. In front of the police, the perpetrators confessed that they acted eight times in the same area.
