* The third time: On a memorable day in May 2020, between 13:00 and 14:00, a car was thrown at a point along National Road 71 near the CPP headquarters. Cambodia is located in Ta Ong commune, Chamkar Leu district, Kampong Cham province.
The 6th time: On a memorable day in July 2020, between 18:00 and 19:00, a stone was thrown at the point along National Road 71 around Bos Khnor Market. Bos Khnour Village, Bos Khnour Commune, Chamkar Leu District, Kampong Cham Province.
The 8th time: On September 29, 2020 at 18:35, they threw stones at the car windshield at the point along National Road 71 in Bang 2 village, Bos Khnour commune, Chamkar Leu district, Kampong Cham province. The windshield shattered and hit a rubber tree, and the victim died after being taken to hospital.
