(Phnom Penh): The administrative police force of Sangkat Phsar Doeum Thkov, Khan Chamkar Mon, this morning, September 3, 2020, arrested a man suspected of having a mental disorder to be sent to the Department of Social Affairs in Phnom Penh after he disturbed To the neighbors at the point near the roundabout in Doeum Thkov market.
The police confirmed that the above man named Chhay Udom, 27 years old, unemployed, living at house No. 27, Street 496, Group 10, located in Village 2, Sangkat Phsar Doeum Thkov, Khan Chamkarmon, Phnom Penh.
So Samban, Phsar Doeum Thkov administrative post chief, said that the neighbors complained to the police for intervention after the man disturbed almost every day. After receiving the complaint, the police force went to the scene since the night of October 2, 2020, but the man was locked inside. Until this morning, the man who had lost his memory walked out of the house and was arrested.
After the arrest, the administrative police examined the man's urine, found drugs, and sent him to the Department of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation in Phnom Penh for education and guidance. What needs to be lit candles on cakes
(Foreign): Birthday celebrations are almost always popular for young people today, especially every birthday party, they always prepare a birthday cake and light candles on the cake. But do you know why candles are lit on birthday cakes like this?
The Greeks, as well as other Europeans, believed that there was only one God who fulfilled the desires of all people, so they also believed that the smoke from the candles on the cakes That will bring all the wishes of the master of the anniversary to the God of heaven.
Around this point, other researchers also say that the candles that burn light represent the light of life. Praying in your heart without telling anyone with the blowing of a candle in one breath will make your wish come true.
For burning candles in this birthday party, it is common to determine the number of candles according to the age of the birthday owner. Birthday parties will not be fun without birthday cakes accompanied by candles.
The rain that flooded National Road No. 4 in Po Sen Chey and Kambol districts receded a lot this morning after Mr. Khuong Sreng ordered the machine to open the water
(Phnom Penh): The Governor of Phnom Penh, Mr. Khuong Sreng, has ordered the authorities to open the rain gear on National Road 4 in Po Sen Chey and Kampol districts. Until the morning of September 3, 2020, the water level has decreased a lot compared to the night of September 2, 2020.
During the inspection on the night of September 2, Mr. Khuong Sreng directly ordered Mr. Saing Piseth, Director of the Department of Public Works and Transport of Phnom Penh and Khan authorities to open a canal at the point along the railway in Trapeang Krasaing village, Sangkat Trapeang Krasaing and Another location along the railway line is in Chung Ruk village in Trapeang Krasang commune to release flood water on National Road 4.
The director of the Phnom Penh Municipal Department of Public Works said that the use of machinery to open the water in these two locations will bring water to the Tuol Sampov canal and continue to flow to the Tuol Sampov pumping station.
According to the district governor, despite the low water level, the authorities are standing to facilitate traffic for people traveling through the flooded area to prevent Extreme traffic congestion.
