During the meeting with many photographers in Cambodia, Mr. Say Sam Al thanked all the photographers who try to capture beautiful images in natural areas across Cambodia.
Mr. Say Sam Al stated that this is an expression of patriotic spirit as a Cambodian citizen who is full of ability to produce beautiful and luxurious images to continue to show the Cambodian people the great beauty of the natural area. Cambodia.
Mr. Say Sam Al said that through the past pictures of Cambodian photographers, it is very important to help spread the word to all the Cambodian public, and this activity also shows the participation in the implementation of better environmental peace in the work. Protect the environment, manage nature, conserve biodiversity and sustainably live.
In addition to the encouragement, the Ministry of Environment also presented certificates of appreciation for environmental friendliness to many photographers.
