Ba Phnom District Working Group, Prey Veng Province, Meeting to Review the Work in September
(Prey Veng): In the afternoon of October 2, 2020, the working group of Ba Phnom district met to review the work in September and set the work direction for the next month.
After the meeting listened to and participated in the discussion on the activity report of Ba Phnom District Working Group in the past, which was briefed by Mr. Mao Eang, Deputy Chairman of the District Working Group, then the Minister and Chairman of the District Working Group summarized and evaluated the work activities. Past, including:
