Oddar Meanchey Provincial Governor Calls on Citizens to Register to Vote and Check All Voter Names
(Oddar Meanchey): Mr. Pen Kosal, Governor of Oddar Meanchey Province, told the people to go and register to vote and check the names of everyone.
Speaking at the groundbreaking ceremony for the construction of a 413-meter-long concrete road in Samrong commune, Samrong city, Oddar Meanchey province, on the morning of October 2, 2020, Mr. Pen Kosal informed the people about the continuous progress of the nation under Led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and President of the Cambodian People's Party.
At the same time, Mr. Pen Kosal also called on the people to go and register to vote and check the names of all voters so that we have the right to vote for our favorite political party that serves the interests of the people and Do not flee the people in times of emergency.
