(Central): Due to jealousy with his wife caused a verbal conflict, a man was forced to use a knife to stab his wife to death immediately at the scene on the night of October 1, 2020 at Street 215, Prek Hoor Keut Village, Sangkat Prek Hoor, Takhmao City, Kandal Province.
According to the police, on the afternoon of October 2, 2020, the victim, Kao Srey Keo, 27 years old, resided in Kampong Po village, Kraing Yov commune, Saang district, Kandal province, working at home. Suspect's name is Sok Sophoan, 38 years old, address is Cheung Prey 2 Village, Ampov Prey Commune, Kandal Steung District, Kandal Province. Occupation: Farmer.
Police recounted that before the incident, the victim and the suspect had been in a love affair for about eight months, having arranged for the elder sister (the victim) to know. Later, the two rented a room in Kampong Samnang village, Sangkat Kampong Samnang, Takhmao city, Kandal province to stay together from time to time, as the man already has a wife and children in Cheung Prey village.
In staying together, the male side is jealous of the female side because there is a suspicion of having a new male. On the day of the incident, when the man came to sleep in the rented room, the woman was chased away to the house, different from usual, making the suspect more and more suspicious, so he refused to go home in Cheung Prey village. See.
The victim then told the suspect to visit the roommate in the delivery room at Phally and Maternity Hospital. Upon arrival at the hospital, the victim chased the suspect home, but the suspect remained under surveillance. Still nearby.
The source added that after a while, he saw the victim walk out of the clinic, talk on the phone, and then take a motorbike taxi to the scene, then the suspect followed the motorcycle until he saw the victim enter. Into a wooden house, a few men are drinking under the front porch.
Sources from the police said that the suspect immediately stabbed two more people in the back and neck and then the suspect rode a motorcycle to the Ampov Prey Administrative Police Station to confess to the authorities. The suspect was then detained and sent to the Takhmao City Police Inspectorate for questioning and case processing.
