(Svay Rieng): More than 500 new street lights on October 1, 2020 were installed by public authorities in Svay Rieng province on public roads in Svay Rieng town for the beauty of the city.
The replacement of these new lamps replaces some of the old ones that were broken after many years of use, especially the more than 500 new bulbs are also installed in Phsar Krol Ko and Phsar Svay Chrum.
