(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Tourism today announced the implementation of tourism safety measures at tourist sites in Phnom Penh, while 33 tourism businesses have properly implemented the health rules to prevent the spread of Kovid-19 disease, which in These include 13 accommodation, tourism, 11 restaurants and 9 inland waterway transport businesses.
