Mr. Hel Raya confirmed that in this survey, the people affected by the Sangkat Road Construction Project will facilitate and ask the affected people to understand and tolerate to speed up the construction.
According to Hel Raya, if the affected people facilitate and resolve this impact quickly, the project could be operational next month.
