The closing ceremony of this important workshop took place on the afternoon of September 30, 2020. Mr. Pheav Sovathy, Deputy Secretary General of the General Secretariat of the National Council for Sustainable Development and a representative of the Ministry of Environment, said at the ceremony that the workshop was conducted smoothly and successfully with the participation of participants, officials, municipal authorities and stakeholders. From the above 4 provinces.
