(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports on October 5, 2020 will celebrate the Teachers' Day on October 5 under the theme "Smart Teachers for Digital Education" at the National Institute of Education.
A press release obtained by Fresh News from the Ministry of Education states that the Teachers' Day on October 5 was held in order to revive the culture and traditions of all students to commemorate the noble merits of teachers across the country. And are also working as educators and knowledge transfer artists, or some teachers have retired.
