(Phnom Penh): Orange juice's IZE, a co-sponsor of the "Srok Yeung Srok" program, offers a variety of prizes for spectators, such as playing an archery game with two animals to create a chance to win souvenirs during the visit. Watch Khmer art performances last weekend.
