Woman stabs husband to death in Preah Sdach district, Prey Veng province
(Prey Veng): A woman stabbed her husband to death with a machete, causing her sudden death due to her husband beating her. In Kdam Puk village, Sena Reach Udom commune, Preah Sdach district, Prey Veng province.
The Preah Sdach District Inspector confirmed that the reason why the family was drunk on the anniversary of both husband and wife and had a dispute was that they were stabbed to death.
