On that occasion, the brigade commander spoke and reminded the people to be extremely careful, especially the natural disasters, floods due to rain and strong winds, which may damage property and crops. There is nothing left if we are negligent.
At the same time, the people are really happy to see the forces descending on time, which helped alleviate their hardships at this time, enabling them to have enough resources to re-store their belongings.
On that occasion, the people and local authorities also thanked the Commander of the Army, the Commander of the 5th Army and the Commander of the 53rd Division, who always take care to assign forces to help people affected by other natural disasters. At all times, the situation is worthy of being an army of the Techo Peace Era.
