Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum Sends Condolences on Death of Senior Minister Osman Hassan
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum and members of the Senate and civil servants of the Secretary General of the Senate this morning, September 28, 2020, sent a message of condolences on the death of the mother of Senior Minister Osman Hassan, Mrs. Hajj Sophos Hassan. Died on Sunday, September 27, 2020 at 6:45 pm at the age of 86 years old.
Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum, please pray to Allah, take care of the soul of Mrs. Hajj Sophos Hassan and may her merit be a good example for the next generation and be a vehicle to send her soul. Hold on to happiness.
