Minister of Tourism: Cambodia is a close friend of Japan and always welcomes Japanese investment, especially in tourism
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Thong Khon, Minister of Tourism, said that Cambodia is a close friend of Japan and always welcomes all Japanese investment, especially in the tourism sector, because Cambodia has a lot of potential that is favorable for investment in the field. Special tourism is ecotourism, agro-tourism as well as rural tourism.
Currently, there is no outbreak of Covid-19 in the community in Cambodia, and patients have been cured. Cambodia has also been actively fighting against Kovid 19 under the guidance of the Royal Government of Cambodia, which is staffed by the Ministry of Health.
