Some of the old roads in Grand Phnom Penh that have been damaged, making it difficult for people inside and outside the community to cross, have been rehabilitated and rebuilt with high quality, ensuring long service life. Irrigation systems and new roads are being built on a regular basis for the common good.
In addition, the nearly 10-hectare reservoir in the Grand Phnom Penh City project, a temporary reservoir, was excavated at the beginning of the initial project development, and a golf course irrigation reservoir is also under development. Also, some are to be developed as luxury housing projects and some are to be developed into American standard green parks that bring overall benefits to the community as a whole.
What are the common benefits that the community living in the Grand Phnom Penh project gets from the development of the temporary reservoir?
A representative of Chip Monglen claims that the main benefits are:
Today, despite the presence of a temporary reservoir, the community enjoys nothing but the view of the lake from a distance or a ride and a place for golf, water, and golf. Taking advantage of this lake is useless.
On the other hand, when the developer of this lake turned into a luxury residential project, the company cut off about 1 hectare of land to build a green park with American standards for relaxation and provide a clean environment for the gym. People in the whole community, without dividing the old or new community.
2: Construction of additional maze road infrastructure in the community
When the company develops the temporary reservoir into an international standard housing and green park project, the road infrastructure in the old community and the new community will be connected, making it easier for people in the community to travel without relying on a single road. . The roads are wide and interconnected.
3: Community property prices will increase even more
It is clear that when there is development, the developed location will benefit more than the undeveloped, and that development is not just for the development site, the adjacent location also draws from this development. In other words, when the temporary reservoir area turns into a standard American luxury resort and green park project, the community adjacent to the new project will definitely get the realization of its property value.
However, the project to convert the temporary reservoir into an American standard green park project has sparked protests from a small number of communities who have demanded that the reservoir be maintained.
Following the protests, the company also addressed the community, and the company maintains the status of a temporary reservoir used to irrigate the golf course into a green natural park for the common good of the community. Living and coming to live in future projects.
The nearly 10-hectare reservoir in the Grand Phnom Penh City project, a temporary reservoir, was excavated at the beginning of project development and serves as a golf course irrigation reservoir. However, this location is a type of construction land as written in the property owner identification certificate No. IX0905, and the company has paid the property tax in accordance with the law.
