Xi stressed that China hopes the two sides will work together to maintain a stable production line and an open and equitable investment environment.
Suga, who became prime minister this September and has little diplomatic experience, must maintain good relations with his larger neighbors as tensions between China and the United States escalate as COVID-19 persists. Continued to spread and especially trade wars between the two economic powers. On Sunday, Suga also spoke by telephone with US President Donald Trump.
