(Phnom Penh): As there are still some property owners who have not yet fulfilled their tax declaration obligations for 2020, on September 25, 2020, the General Department of Taxation issued a notification on the postponement of property tax payment. For the year 2020 until October 31, 2020.
In the announcement, the General Department of Taxation stated that in accordance with the laws and regulations in force, taxpayers are obliged to declare this tax no later than September 30 of each tax year. If this period expires, the taxpayer will be punished in accordance with the tax law in force.
In order to enable property owners who are willing to fulfill this tax declaration obligation but have not yet submitted their tax declaration, the General Department of Taxation has decided to extend the expiration date for property tax declaration for 2020 until October 31, 2020, free from punishment.
