(Phnom Penh): The case of the murder of a Chinese boss in Phnom Penh's Sen Sok district, and the body was put in a black bag and put in a suitcase and dumped in Kampong Speu province, was successfully investigated and dismantled by the police, leading to the arrest of the perpetrator Who are the descendants of the victims on September 25, 2020.
The operation was carried out by the Criminal Police Department in collaboration with the Sen Sok District Police and the Kampong Speu Provincial Police under the command of General Dr. Neth Savoeun, National Police Commissioner, Deputy Commissioner for Criminal Planning, Lt. Gen. Neng Chuor, Director of the Criminal Police Department and Coordinated by the representative of the Prosecutor of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court.
According to the police, the technical, scientific and forensic examination of the body, there were bruises on the back of the head and wounds on the right and left neck.
