After the killings, they packed the bodies in a black suitcase in a Highlander truck and dropped them off on National Road 4, two to three kilometers past Yeay Mao (Phnom Pich Nil). The car returned to Phnom Penh and was detained by the authorities.
The suspect is currently being investigated by the Criminal Police Department and sent to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court for sentencing.
