(Phnom Penh): A suspect was arrested by the Dangkor Administrative Police immediately after riding a motorcycle and shocked a woman. The incident happened at 4:05 pm on September 22, 2020 at the Bakou stop along Street 217 in Sangkat Dangkor, Khan Dangkor, Phnom Penh.
