Minister Veng Sakhon stated that all this has been contributing significantly to the development of Cambodia's agricultural sector to ensure food security, improve living standards, increase production, including aquaculture, horticulture, animal husbandry and Rice crops.
In addition, the agricultural sector is expanding its production potential through the modernization of agriculture, incorporating climate-appropriate technologies, climate change and innovation, in order to achieve the Royal Government's vision for 2030 and 2050, and in particular Steps towards becoming an agricultural exporter to international markets.
