In this case, the Kampong Chhnang Provincial Gendarmerie will continue to interrogate and search for the suspect in accordance with the procedures to find out whether the victim died from a gunshot or a murder, and whether the suspect had a handgun. Where to use this brand, whether it is legal or not, when we receive clear information, Fresh News will continue to broadcast.
Please be informed that as of 2:00 pm today, the Kampong Chhnang Provincial Armed Forces are still questioning the two suspects.
