General knowledge: Who created the first world map and how did the world map evolve?
(World): Before the creation of a complete world map, people were only capable of drawing maps for their country or the landscape around them, such as the sky, stars, forests, mountains, rivers, seas and cities, but later humans developed Ability to map the entire world and easily use up to date.
On the world map, the Greeks identified only two continents, Europe and Asia. What is special about the previous maps is that they added longitudinal and transverse lines as well as the North Pole (looking directly at the earth) on their map. Compared to the world map of Anarchimander, the map of the next generation is easier to see than just the division of continents is not yet accurate.
Later, the world also reached the modern age, people can build air balloons, can fly airplanes, can even build satellites, thus making the world map even more accurate. This achievement clears the skepticism of humanity in defining the world map after more than ten thousand years of continuous creation and processing.
Two groups of hippies cut each other at Teuk Cha resort, Prey Chhor district, were cracked down by 4 people in Kampong Cham province
(Kampong Cham): In the case of two groups of hippies who killed each other in the area of Teuk Cha resort in Thmey village, Krouch commune, Prey Chhor district, Kampong Cham province, the police force of Kampong Cham Provincial Police cracked down on 4 people and confiscated a glue stick and 2 motorbikes .
According to the General Commissioner, the cause of the violence was caused by motorcyclists competing with each other while the victims came out to visit the waterfront at the Teuk Cha resort area.
Immediately after the incident, he ordered the forces of the Prey Chhor District Police Inspectorate and the forces of the Orange Administrative Police Station, led by Colonel Keo Seang Hean, the District Police Inspector, as well as the target force, to arrive at the scene to crack down and arrest people. Four suspects and two others escaped and confiscated exhibits, including a sword and two motorbikes.
Currently, four suspects, along with the above exhibits, have been brought to the Prey Chhor District Police Inspectorate for questioning and case processing, while the other two suspects are being sought by the authorities for legal action.
It should be noted that Major General Em Kosal always pays close attention and submits to all forces in the 10 district police inspectorates for measures to curb gang activities as well as other crimes that occur. As well as cracking down on many cases in the past. Summary of important news events for September 14, 2020
