Moreover, according to the sermons of many famous monks in the Kingdom of Cambodia, if any person has done good deeds in the high season during the Kan Ben and Pchum Ben festivals. In 7 pagodas, those individuals will receive the highest non-monastic fruit and the best civilization to support you both now and in the future.
