(Phnom Penh): Net Pheaktra, Secretary of State and Spokesman for the Ministry of Environment, said, "Green Cambodia has a clean, comfortable and aesthetic environment for Cambodians to live and attract more and more tourists."
Mr. Neth Pheaktra made this remark on September 14, 2020, when he presided over a workshop on the legalization of environmental friendliness and environmental friendliness certification program for the youth working group. The Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, Phnom Penh and related departments participated in education, dissemination, sanitation, environment and waste management on the occasion of the Water Festival, floating lanterns and worshiping the moon last year.
On that occasion, Mr. Neth Pheaktra said that the award of environmental friendliness is a thank you to all the volunteers who have always participated in environmental clean-up activities in Phnom Penh in major national festivals such as the Water Festival. Originally and also a recognition of the spirit of responsibility as a citizen who dedicated his time, physical and mental strength to clean up the environment and participate in the implementation of environmental friendliness better.
Mr. Neth Pheaktra continued that the activities that youth groups, institutions and other organizations have joined together to clean up the environment in the major national festivals are to participate in educating and promoting people to love the environment and clean up the environment together. .
The spokesman for the Ministry of Environment added, "The Ministry of Environment always encourages and pays tribute to natural persons and legal entities who have implemented environmental friendliness well and encourages other citizens to participate." "Environmental friendliness, that is, participating in cleaning the environment, keeping garbage properly."
Mr. Neth Pheaktra stated that before adding that every citizen has a duty to clean up the environment around them and take care of the existing natural resources, and the encouragement of those who have practiced good environmental friendliness is necessary to inspire love. More environment among the people.
According to Mr. Neth Pheaktra, in the last 10 years, people have become more aware of environmental issues, but participation is still limited and it is very important to promote awareness. As a more environmentally friendly operation.
He emphasized that Cambodia is rich in natural cultural heritage, has many tourist attractions that attract national and international tourists to visit, and the environment is beautiful, not polluted by garbage, plastic waste and dirty environment will attract more tourists. Therefore, it is necessary for all of us to participate in cleaning the environment regularly.
At the same time, Mr. Net Pheaktra said that the Royal Government of Cambodia has a vision to build Cambodia as a high middle income country by 2030 and to be a high income country by 2050 in the environmental vision is Cambodia 2050 environmental quality and Environmental sustainability is guaranteed and people will be more educated and more actively involved in environmental causes and natural resources in line with national and global developments.
