Oddar Meanchey Provincial Governor Continues to Call on People to Follow the Guidelines of the Ministry of Health to Prevent Kovid 19 Infection on the Occasion of Pchum Ben
(Oddar Meanchey): Mr. Pen Kosal, Governor of Oddar Meanchey Province, this morning, September 14, 2020, continued to call on the people to continue to implement the guidelines of the Ministry of Health to prevent the spread of Kovid 19, especially on the occasion of Pchum Ben. .
Mr. Pen Kosal made this call on the occasion of the representative of Senior Minister Kun Kim, Chairman of the Royal Government Working Group to visit Oddar Meanchey province, leading the Armed Forces to participate in the 12th Ben in Wat Chey Teuk Chum, also known as Wat Anlong Veng in Anlong Veng commune. Anlong Veng District, Oddar Meanchey Province.
