General knowledge: 10 countries with the best hospitality for foreigners
9: Ireland The Irish are generous and always happy to hear your story. Whether you are just a tourist or have just moved to this country and want to make friends, you will be asked about your experiences in Ireland and get tips and advice on great places to visit. Bad place here.
8. Costa Rica This Central American country is one of the most beautiful natural landscapes in the world and it is just one of the reasons why Costa Rica is so popular among foreigners. The people of Costa Rica are amazing, not inferior to the landscape of this country. Tourists or foreigners who arrive there will be warmly welcomed, and making friends and adapting to the Costa Ricans is surprisingly easy.
7. Iceland This small island nation is located in the northern part of the Atlantic Ocean and is increasingly popular with foreigners. Apart from the scenery and natural hot springs, Blue Lagoon Iceland has one of the most friendly people and they are always happy to give as much welcome as possible to everyone.
6. Vietnam Vietnam is also a country that is considered to have a very friendly people.
5. Philippines Whether you are just going on vacation or moving to the Philippines, you will find a community that gives you a warm and welcoming welcome. The Philippines is also a multicultural destination that attracts both tourists and migrants.
4: Mexico The people of this Latin American country are very friendly to foreigners and they are always happy to listen to your problems and help you.
3. Canadians In general, Canadians are considered to be a very friendly people. According to many polls, this North American country has always been among the most friendly countries in the world. All Canadians enjoy exploring different cultures and enjoying making friends.
2: New Zealand New Zealand is a country with beautiful scenery or beaches. The people here are well-mannered and always waiting to help foreigners.
1: Cambodia Cambodia is considered a country that is becoming a paradise for foreigners who come to live here. According to the survey, most Cambodians are very friendly and welcoming to foreigners, whether tourists or migrants.
