Tbong Khmum Provincial Public Works Department Absolutely Rejects Serious Distortion on Toul Toteung Weighing Station
(Tbong Khmum): The Department of Public Works and Transport of Tbong Khmum Province has issued a press release rejecting and completely rejecting the misrepresentation of the content related to Thnal Toteung scale station in some newspapers, which has seriously affected the management and officials of this scale station.
In a press release issued by the Tbong Khmum Provincial Public Works Department on September 4-7, 2020, an attack was made on the management of the road station.
The Provincial Public Works Department has completely denied and rejected the above content, which distorts false information, slanders the leaders and officials of the road weighing station, and makes baseless and inaccurate conclusions for the purpose of inciting Chaos and loss of trust from government officials, the public and the people on the station.
In the case of a vehicle with the correct weight, the vehicle is allowed to continue without any extracurricular payments.
