(Phnom Penh): Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation of Cambodia, attended the first Mekong-US Partnership Foreign Ministerial Meeting via Video, which was held on September 11, 2013. 2020.
1: Future partnerships should be built on effective and experienced mechanisms to expand the scope of cooperation through specific programs or practical action plans that can deliver tangible and influential results for the region and its people.
