The meeting also highlighted the importance of continuing cooperation to reduce the impact of Kovid-19 and facilitate sustainable rehabilitation after the outbreak. The meeting recognized the need for unhindered and timely access to quality, safe, effective and affordable vaccines, tests and diagnostic tests to combat the disease.
In addition, the meeting approved the Joint Declaration of the Secretary of State of the Mekong-US Partnership and agreed on the basic documents of the Mekong-US Partnership.
