Causes of the Twelve Doomsday, the advice of the Samma Samputa, reminds Buddhists of the Pchum season (Phnom Penh): Kan Ben festival, as well as Pchum Ben festival, which is a major festival in Khmer Buddhism, not only to educate people to know how to celebrate And thanks to the rich and virtuous, but on the occasion of this 15-day festival also educated the Buddhists to understand the cause of destruction.
Every morning from the first day of Kan Ben to the day of Pchum Ben or Pchum Thom (starting from the 1st day of Roach to the 15th day of Roach Kheap) they always hear the monks chanting the Dharma called Prabhupada. Prabhupada Sutra is the Dharma of Samma Samputa, admonishing the Buddhists of the 12 causes leading to destruction in daily life.
The following is a summary of the meanings of the Dharma, as well as the causes of the 12 doomsday:
The following is the full text of the Dharma Sutra:
Men and women in the world of conquest that will perish and disappear.
Naturally, how the chief brings animals to doom.
Preah Sastha replied to the deity:
Sovicheanophavum Hort Sovicheanoprabhavo Dhammakamophavum Horthamtasey Prabhavo.
Those who prosper, I know easily, those who perish, I know the truth
You aspire to goodness in your heart and strive to prosper.
Those who resist the Dharma, hate the Dharma, do not grow, do not grow, do not prosper.
This doom, if you count salvation and doom, is the first name.
Blessed One, the Name of the Blessed One, may you be summoned to give alms.
The second doom is what leads animals to doom.
He who loves, loves only those who are not kind
Love satisfies the idea and goes to throw the really unkind
This doom, if you count salvation, doom, the second name is yet to come.
The third doom is what leads animals to doom.
One who sleeps a lot, talks a lot, and who is carefree
Lazy people do not have a lot of zeal and anger to show off.
Those causes are not good, leading to failure and damage.
This doom, if saved, is the third name.
The fourth doom is what brings animals to doom.
Elderly parents are therefore doomed.
This doom, if you count the doomsday, is the fourth name.
The fifth doom is what leads animals to doom.
Deceptive Brahmins or monks, beggars or others
By lying away from the good word, the head of doom.
This doom, if you count the saved doom, is the fifth name.
The sixth doom is what brings animals to doom.
Rich man, rich in gold, silver, prosperity, and food
Concealing delicious things, eating alone is the chief of doom.
This doom, if you count the saved doom, is the sixth name yet.
The seventh doom is what brings animals to doom.
Cheat Tattho Thun Tho Tho Kott Tho Thoch Yoan Roh Sansa Te Atimanimet Tam Praphavtao Mukham.
This doom, if you count the saved doom, is the seventh name yet.
The eighth doom is what leads animals to doom.
Three Gamblers, Girl Games, Wine Games, Betting
Make your property dangerous, those games bring destruction.
This doom, if you count the saved doom, is the eighth name.
The ninth doom is what leads animals to doom.
A man who is not happy with his wife and gets involved with a prostitute
Rebellion with wives and children, therefore leading to destruction.
This doom, if you count salvation, doom, the ninth name.
The 10th doom is what brings animals to doom.
Former Yopvano Boso Anetiti Mpruth Nitsa Isan Sopati Tam Prabhupato Mokham.
Men who are too old to have orgasms with lust
Bringing a young girl to be his wife is therefore destructive.
This doom, if you count the saved doom, is the tenth name.
The 11th doom is what brings animals to doom.
Itthy Sondi, Vikirnu, Borisam, Veta, Bita, Tisam, Issriya, Smith, Betam, Tam, Prabhupada, Mokham.
Men nominate women, waste players or women nominate men
This doom, if you count the saved doom, is the 11th name yet.
Doom 12 What is the leader that leads animals to doom.
Whoever is born into a royal family, is poor, and has great aspirations
At the end of the world, Dr. Samvekkhei, the Noble Philosopher, is the creator of the Kingdom of Cambodia.
People with good ideas see the process of doom
