Also in this meeting, Brigadier General Huot Sothy disseminated the plan to protect Pchum Ben to all forces to pay attention to command and lead the force professionally to protect safety, security and order to the people, especially on the occasion of Kan Day Ben and Pchum Ben. Must strengthen patrols and command 24 hours a day to facilitate the situation and intervene in time when people need help.
