(Banteay Meanchey): Husband divorced and wanted to have sex with his wife, refused to cut his wife with 5 knives, without fear, causing serious injuries, was sent to Mongkol Borei Hospital, while the suspect, the husband escaped in Sala Cheh village, commune Rohal, Preah Net Preah District, Banteay Meanchey Province.
