Recognize the identity of the woman who jumped to her death on the Chroy Changvar bridge, the public wants the authorities to investigate further on this case because they are afraid it is not a suicide
(Phnom Penh): A beautiful woman who decided to commit suicide by jumping on the Chroy Changvar Bridge on the night of September 11, 2020 has been identified by sharing messages of condolence and regret from The victim's friends on Facebook.
However, around this incident, the public wants the authorities to open more research to determine whether the victim jumped to his death or something else that is still a mystery. The reason they say this is a mystery is because the car stopped and gave the victim a chance to jump.
Other information received at the scene revealed that the woman and the driver of the car had an argument before the car left. However, this is only the information that they received the first step at the scene, so the public wants the authorities to open further investigation into this case.
