Dak Ben 9 ceremony, which took place on the morning of Friday, 4th of Roach, year of Chot Tosak, BE 2564, which is on September 11, 2020, many Buddhists happily participated in Dak Ben and brought gifts. Monks also flocked to dedicate merits to the souls of ancestors, ancestors, relatives, and seven generations who have passed away.
