During this Kanben turn, Samdech Kittipritthbandit and his family brought 22 kinds of gifts, including rice, orange juice, pure water, avant-garde, soy sauce, seaweed, kulen water, bagas, condensed milk, sugar, cocoa beans, tea cans, fish cakes. Dried fish, sausage, noodles, fruits, cakes and so on. In particular, there is also an alcohol mask to prevent the spread of Kovid 19 and other diseases.
