Murder! Wife kills husband in Preah Vihear province, arrested by military forces and sent to court
(Preah Vihear): Police in Preah Vihear province on September 11, 2020, arrested a woman after killing her husband with a rosewood stick in Antel village, Yeang commune, Choam Ksan district, Preah Vihear province.
At 08:40 on September 9, 2020, a murder occurred in Antel village, Yeang commune, Choam Ksan district, causing a man to die in a pool of blood with a stick. The rosewood stick hit the victim on the eyebrow, breaking his jaw and breaking his right knife.
Brigadier General Kang Sao Kun confirmed that after the incident, the police conducted a thorough search to arrest the suspect, then the police set a clear target that the murder case was the wife of the killer, but the police did not. The suspect woke up, giving the suspect a chance to complete the ceremony for her husband.
He said that after burying his husband, his wife was immediately arrested by the military police and the suspect admitted that he had actually killed her husband because he was angry and often drank alcohol and used a lot of violence on her. Raise until you feel angry that one day you will kill your husband.
Currently, the female perpetrators and exhibits have been sent to the Preah Vihear Provincial Gendarmerie Command by the Choam Ksan District Military Police for legal action.
