(Phnom Penh): General Vong Pisen, Commander-in-Chief of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces (RCAF), presided over a retirement ceremony this morning, September 11, 2020. The ceremony was held at the Naval Command, with the participation of the Commander-in-Chief, Deputy Commander-in-Chief and the leadership of the officers under the command.
