The purpose of this meeting was to review the draft Ministerial Declaration on Labor Social Security Mobility for Migrant Workers in order to establish a common mechanism for mobilizing the benefits of Social Security from one country to another. Among CLMTV countries, will promote the rights of migrant workers, as well as to strengthen labor cooperation between CLMTV countries.
