(Central): Three senior CPP officials, including Senator Lan Chhorn, Senator Chhay Vanna and Secretary of State for the Ministry of Rural Development Hab Omaly, met with commune chiefs, post chiefs and commune councilors from Tuol Snoul Chhouk Bes 2 commune. If you want to know more about the provision of services to the people in the 6 villages and communes of Krouch Chhmar district, especially to inspire people to beware of Kovid-19 disease.
