Addressing the meeting, Ms. Khuon Sodary spoke about the situation of Cambodian women, saying that women workers and employees in Cambodia have been severely affected by the Kovid 19 epidemic, with about 60% of small and medium enterprises in Cambodia taking over. Or controlled by women. On the other hand, the textile and footwear industries, as well as the tourism sector, account for 84% of the female workforce.
