The Commission has the duty to mediate disputes of journalists registered with the Ministry of Information, which is subject to complaints from stakeholders during their professional duties. Receive complaints from journalists who have disputes during the profession, review the facts and the law on each complaint to the management to decide.
In addition, the committee conducts consultations to discuss possible issues before publishing news articles related to sensitive issues. Facilitate the submission of professional journalists' complaints to Samdech Techo Sen's group of volunteer lawyers. The commission also monitors the implementation of each grievance procedure from start to finish and reports regularly to management.
