The completed exploration license application must be accompanied by the relevant documents and reports and placed in a sealed envelope with the words "Competitive Application" on the back and submitted to the Ministry at the OWSO. »Of the Ministry of Mines and Energy no later than October 5, 2020 at 17:00.
