Minister of Labor urges students preparing to study in Australia and New Zealand to strive to fulfill their knowledge while maintaining a strong national spirit
(Phnom Penh): In a meeting with a group of students who are preparing to go to study in Australia and New Zealand, Mr. Ith Sam Heng, Minister of Labor and Vocational Training instructed them to work hard to study to complete their knowledge. It comes to help develop the motherland of Cambodia under the spirit of striving for the nation as a whole.
