On the other hand, for those who have performed meritorious deeds in pure and pure devotion in the Pchum Ben ceremony, those individuals are descended from Kol Thida, who are grateful to their parents and those who are grateful if their parents or you His merit has passed on to the next world, and his soul will go to a higher place and help to take care of his children to experience all kinds of happiness and prosperity.
