Construction of 34 concrete roads in Sihanoukville is almost complete
(Sihanoukville): The 34 concrete roads in Sihanoukville, built by the national budget and by Cambodian experts, are nearing completion. This is according to Mr. Ho Chantha, Project Coordinator, National Committee for Coastal Management and Development of Cambodia.
Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, Governor of Preah Sihanouk Province, on September 7, 2020, chaired a meeting to monitor and evaluate the progress of the construction of these 34 roads. The meeting was attended by the Deputy Governor, the Director of Administration, the Governor of Sihanoukville, departments, units and road construction companies.
Mr. Ho Chantha stated that the construction of 34 concrete roads in Sihanoukville has reached 99.92 percent, rainwater and sewage works have reached 100 percent, granite sidewalks have reached 83.45 percent and Granite flooring achieved 24%.
In particular, the installation of street lighting poles reached 64% and installed more than 53%, the planting of trees on both sides of the road reached 32% and the installation of security cameras achieved 10%.
The construction of these 34 roads will cost about 300 million US dollars. Apart from the national budget, the road construction experts and workers are all Cambodians. The Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, has shown great pride in the construction of these roads.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also praised the people in Sihanoukville who cooperated with the authorities to build roads without demanding compensation for their property. That is, the construction of this road does not have to pay for the impact on the property of the people.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen considered the people of Sihanoukville hungry for the road more than anything.
It should be noted that in order to improve the beauty and facilitate traffic in Sihanoukville, Cambodia's main tourist and economic destination in the southwest, the Royal Government has decided to reduce the national budget to about 300 million US dollars to build A total of 34 major and minor roads with a total length of 82,145 km in Sihanoukville.
