Soeur Pheap, 45, a resident of Svay Kun village, Chrey commune, Svay Antor district, Prey Veng province, said on September 7, 2020 that her husband, Muong Pum, was 72 years old. She said that before going to treat her husband, she only had a fever, stomach ache, a slight stomach ache. On the morning of September 1, 2020, she and her husband rode a motorbike to consult and treat at the clinic above.
According to the source, the doctor gave her husband a rest at the clinic and prepared injections, swallows and serums, causing the patient to feel worse. Until the evening of September 2, 2020, seeing that the patient was in severe pain, lost consciousness, lost consciousness and lost his breath.
