Speaking on that occasion, the Deputy Prime Minister also brought a message from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross, who always consider the well-being of veterans. Across the country that has contributed to the liberation and protection of the Cambodian people in the past.
Ms. Kittisangkhab Dr. Men Sam An continued that under the wise leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Veterans Association, he led the country through a very difficult period to achieve peace and achieve great achievements. Successful and developed history in all fields. All of these successes are also inseparable from the merits and contributions of the veterans present here.
