(Phnom Penh): The "Cambodian Spirit" campaign, which distributes Cambodian pure water to traffic police across the country since the beginning of August, has been hailed by the public.
"Cambodian Spirit" is a campaign initiated by Cambodian Pure Water with the aim of donating back to society after seeing that police officers always work hard day and night, so what to do to repay them.
Therefore, the Cambodian Pure Water Company also donated more than 20,000 cases of Cambodian pure water and fruit juice to the joint police officers.
"Cambodian Spirit" will distribute pure Cambodian drinking water and fruit juice every month to the joint police across the country from August to the end of 2020.
In the past, Pure Water Cambodia has provided products and charitable assistance to police officers and hospitals. Helping each other is a responsible spirit and a vision of Cambodian Pure Water Products.
