He said that in reducing the impact of Kovid 19, Australia has made efforts to actively contribute to help the Royal Government of Cambodia reduce the impact as well as reduce the spread of this disease. At the same time, Australia has assisted in the creation of a database of the poor in Cambodia and is currently continuing to support additional work to support the Royal Government's measures to provide support to the poor.
