(Central): Imprisoned five times and still disfigured A man, after being released from prison, still stormed the village, throwing stones at the walls and roof of Takhmao residents' houses, often without fear of anyone Yi Vanda, Takhmao City Police Inspector, ordered the police to arrest him immediately after receiving a series of complaints.
