For this afternoon, agricultural inputs to be distributed to 84 families in Tonlong commune, 84 animals, 260 fishing nets, 84 rubber covers, 360 nursery trays, 84 cucumber seeds, 168 bags of beans 84 baskets of kale, 84 baskets of kale, 84 baskets to be grown on 10 hectares of land.
