(Phnom Penh): The 8-meter-deep sewer drilling site, a new technology for automatic drilling of underground sewers without the use of people, from the front of the old stadium of Street 70, with a length of 1,552 meters to the pool. The underground garden in front of the Council for the Development of Cambodia has been completed.
It should be noted that the new technology using modern machinery (Jack King drilling) started to open on September 10, 2019 in front of Bun Rany Hun Sen High School, Wat Phnom, Daun Penh, in the presence of Mr. Sam Piseth, Director of the Department of Public Works and Transport Phnom Penh and representatives of the Embassy of Japan in Cambodia and representatives of JICA.
