The National Assembly of the National Confederation of Unions of Cambodia, in collaboration with the Sen Sok district administration, sprayed pesticides on the homes, workers and workplaces for the second time.
(Phnom Penh): The National Assembly of the National Union of Cambodia (NACC) and the Sen Sok District Administration on August 31, 2020 continued the spraying activities to prevent and prevent Kovid disease in 19 rented rooms of workers and officials' offices. A total of 520 rooms in Phnom Penh Thmey and Teuk Thla communes.
