(Battambang): 33 out of 335 stalls in Battambang cloth market were completely engulfed by fire yesterday evening, August 30, and this morning, August 31, 2020, Mr. Nguon Rattanak, Battambang Provincial Governor. Lead a professional team to meet and talk to the affected market traders.
