Kampong Cham Provincial Authority Completes the Order of Phsar Phav Town
(Kampong Cham): Kampong Cham provincial authorities have successfully put order in Phsar Phav town after Kampong Cham provincial governor Un Chanda set up a committee headed by Deputy Provincial Governor Ou Phoeun Kunvuth and Deputy Provincial Administration Director Sam Piseth. The three types of armed forces cooperated with the Batheay district authorities to carry out this work for 33 days.
