Mr. Veng Sakhon, Minister of Agriculture, also went to O'Peut Village, Sangkat Pailin, Pailin City to inspect the vegetable garden of Nhep Keo's family who received a net house (10 meters by 36 meters) from the program to promote new agricultural techniques resistant to climate change. .
