The Royal Government of Cambodia has been paying close attention to increasing the capacity of the rescue team to respond to any incidents that may occur. Mr. Kun Kim considered the opening of the rescue training for the troops in the 3rd Intervention Division as an important training course to respond in time when a disaster occurs in Preah Vihear as well as Oddar Meanchey.
The Senior Minister urged all participants to pay attention to the skills of the trainers in this training course to strengthen the rescue capacity. The First Vice-Chairman of the National Committee for Disaster Management also reminded all rescue participants to adhere to the spirit of rescue, must endure, overcome difficulties to achieve the operation is to save the lives of the victims. .
"The disaster relief operation is also a battlefield," he warned. This battle is also very important because we have to save the lives of the victims. "There is nothing more important than this life, so when entering this battle, we as rescuers must be determined and determined to overcome all difficulties with the utmost vigor to achieve our main goal is to save the lives of the victims."
In the opening ceremony of this training course this morning, due to the Intervention Division 3, a division established by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia during the Cambodian war with Thailand in 2008, there are also some memories from 12 That year, too.
Lt. Gen. Srey Duek, Deputy Commander of the Jingkork Army and Commander of the 3rd Brigade, recalled the leadership of Senior Minister Kun Kim at the Cambodian-Thai border battle, in general and in particular at the 1st Battlefield, Preah Vihear Temple. Resolve the situation in time to protect the territorial integrity.
Ms. Duc reminded that by strictly following Samdech Techo's orders and the reprimand of Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, General Kun Kim always joined the army on the front lines to solve all difficulties for the army and family. Make the armed forces in the border battle always remember the actions of General Kun Kim.
Kun Kim also recalled the brave memories of the Cambodian army 12 years ago, fighting on the battlefield to defend territorial integrity under the command of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Cambodia's Supreme Commander-in-Chief. Mr. Kun Kim reminded that under the care and direct command of Samdech Techo, the army at the Battle of Prasidh was named after Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittiprittbandit as the General General of the Army.
The senior minister said that although he now has to go to work in the civilian sector, he still misses and thinks of the army. Mr. Kun Kim also praised all the troops who worked hard to fulfill all tasks and instructed the Armed Forces to remember, be grateful for peace, be grateful to the founder of peace, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, and must strictly obey the orders of Samdech Cho Pramuk Reach. Government by protecting territorial integrity.
After opening the rescue training and meeting with the army, Senior Minister Kun Kim also went to visit the troops standing at the foot of Preah Vihear and Phnom Chak Chreng mountains, which are the traces of the joint struggle to defend the territorial integrity of the 12 years. Last year.
