(Phnom Penh): Mr. Prum Samkhan, Chairman of Chamkar Mon District Council, praised the efforts of Khan Unity Command on crime suppression, law enforcement and local gambling to achieve good results. Complimented by the people who came to receive the service.
He said this at the 15th Ordinary Meeting of its third mandate this morning, August 28, 2020, with the participation of Mr. Theng Sothol, District Governor, as well as with the participation of Khan Councilors, Khan Governors. Director-Deputy Director of Khan Administration, Police Inspector of Khan, Military Police Command, Military District, Special Zone, Khan Office, Sub-specialized Office around Khan 5, Sangkat Chief 2, Market Chief 2 and other relevant officials.
However, challenges remain in the neighborhoods, such as the use of sidewalks as shopping areas, anarchy, public order, traffic and drug issues, and construction issues that the district authorities must continue to address. Resolve. At the same time, Mr. Prom Samkhan also encouraged the district board of governors to continue to crack down on crime and to organize order on the streets for the well-being of the local people.
It should be noted that the meeting also raised the agenda and discussed as follows:
1: Review and approve the draft minutes of the 14th Ordinary Meeting of Chamkar Mon District Council, 3rd mandate on July 29, 2020: Review and approve the draft report for August and the work direction for September 2020 on Performance of Chamkarmon District Administration. 3: Examine and approve the distribution of bonuses to Chamkarmon Khan Administration staff.
Mr. Chamkar Mon District Governor also reminded the Sangkat authorities to continue to disseminate measures to prevent and prevent the spread of Covid 19 to people in homes and communities on a regular basis. Japan will allow foreigners to return to the country from September
